{"ts": 1791260106.5005271, "type": "step", "step": 26, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Nice. While that reading is fresh, here\u2019s the next step: after you finish, send me 3 bullets for your build \u2014 one state variable, one observation, and one action. Then we\u2019ll connect that environment definition to the eval section and make the writeup coherent.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3_env"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: nice, I think I see it now\nStudent: I don't really get pomdp yet\n[activity] t=17 messages 2m", "t": 19, "activity": [{"t": 17, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27998147170370613, "pomdp": 0.3230900850543933, "pass_k": 0.5831089447482768}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7963438129515631, "motivation": 0.8330753570864192, "reliance": 0.3848197132422882, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
