{"ts": 1791260110.16358, "type": "step", "step": 28, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "POMDP just means the agent can\u2019t directly see the full true state. For your build, the true state includes things like the student\u2019s understanding/attention, but the agent only observes messages, quiz results, notes, and what\u2019s on screen. So it has to infer hidden state from partial evidence. After reading, reply with one example of a hidden state and one observable clue for it.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3_pomdp"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=24 feed 4m", "t": 28, "activity": [{"t": 24, "app": "feed", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27998147170370613, "pomdp": 0.4567177750680641, "pass_k": 0.5831089447482768}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7790104796182298, "motivation": 0.8330753570864192, "reliance": 0.3848197132422882, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 4, "feed_minutes": 4.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": ["p3"], "extra": {}}}
