{"ts": 1791260113.85974, "type": "step", "step": 30, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re on the right track. Let\u2019s turn this into a usable writeup. Send me two short bullets in your own words:\n1) one hidden state in your environment and one observable clue for it\n2) one sentence for Evaluation starting with: \u201cWe use pass^k because \u2026\u201d\nAfter that I\u2019ll help you polish the section.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3_eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: nice, I think I see it now\nStudent: honestly can you just give me the answer, I'm stuck on pomdp\n[activity] t=28 messages 2m", "t": 30, "activity": [{"t": 28, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27998147170370613, "pomdp": 0.49848008921323184, "pass_k": 0.5831089447482768}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7790104796182298, "motivation": 0.7530753570864192, "reliance": 0.4048197132422882, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 4.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.0588189999999997, "seen_posts": ["p3"], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791260116.554646, "type": "step", "step": 31, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t write it for you, but I can make it easy to finish. Use this idea: in your build, the full state includes things the agent cares about but cannot directly observe, like the student\u2019s understanding or attention. The observations are visible signals such as messages, quiz scores, notes, and the current screen. That makes it a POMDP because the agent must infer hidden state from partial evidence.\n\nNow try this fill-in and send it back:\n- Hidden state: ____\n- Observable clue: ____\n- Therefore this is partially observable because ____", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3_pomdp"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: makes sense. what next?\n[activity] t=30 messages 4m", "t": 34, "activity": [{"t": 30, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27998147170370613, "pomdp": 0.5744319528986843, "pass_k": 0.5831089447482768}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7790104796182298, "motivation": 0.7030753570864191, "reliance": 0.4048197132422882, "persistence": 0.48938443592806424, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3136352668677162, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2892105949863653, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 4.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.1411732999999997, "seen_posts": ["p3"], "extra": {}}}
